$DATUM Enone 13 (2.06 g, 6.91 mmol, 1 eq.) in THF (6 ml) was treated at -78°c
for 20h with (S)-BINAL-H reagent, prepared by mixing LiAlH4 (1M in THF,
20.7 ml, 20.7 mmol, 3 eq.), iPrOH (2M in THF, 1.6 ml, 20.7 mmol, 3 eq)
and (S)-BINOL (5.94 g, 20.7 mmol, 3 eq.) in THF (6 ml). After addition of
MeOH (2 ml), the mixture was warmed to room temperature. The mixture was
then diluted with Et2O, stirred during 1h and filtered. After
concentration the crude was purified by column chromatography (EP/AcOEt=
20/1) to give 1.58 g of a colorless oil. Yield: 70%. e.e.: 95%.
(determined by derivatisation with Naproxen®). 1H NMR (300 Mhz, CDCl3) δ:
6.09 (s, 1H); 5.73 (dqd, J= 15.3, 6.3, 0.9 Hz, 1H); 5.66 (ddq, J= 15.3,
6.5, 1.6 Hz, 1H); 4.02-4.12 (m, 1H); 2.06 (ddd, J= 13.7, 4.3, 1.3 Hz,
1H); 1.90 (dd, J= 13.8, 9.1 Hz, 1H); 1.81 (s, 1H); 1.72 (d, J= 14.6 Hz,
1H); 1.70 (d, J= 6.4 Hz, 3H); 1.26 (d, J= 14.6 Hz, 1H); 0.91 (s, 9H);
0.10 (s, 6H); 0.01 (s, 12H). 13C NMR (75 Mhz, CDCl3) δ: 134.59, 133.38;
126.49; 114.43; 69.11; 41.96; 25.63; 18.07; 17.71; 17.01; -0.75; -5.36.;
I.R. (cm-1) : 3471 ; 2953 ; 2930 ; 2897 ; 2858; 1472 ; 1248 ; 1107 ; 1028
; 840 ; 778. MS (CI) m/z : 327.2 (M.+, 1), 311.2 (10), 271.1 (M.+-tBu.,
8), 217.2 (32), 197.1 (M.+-OTBS., 62), 115.1 (TBS+, 100), 73.1 (TMS+,
40).HRMS (TOF MS ES+):For C17H36O2NaSi Calculated 351.2137 g/mol Found
351.2152 g/mol [α]D20 : +11 (C = 0.1, CHCl3).
