$DATUM (3,4-Dimethoxyphenyl)ethyleneglycol (5). A solution of dry THF (50 mL)
containing 1.0 M LiAlH4 (4.0 mL, 4.0 mmol) and 9S (0.5 g, 2.0 mmol) was
stirred for 3 h at room temperature, diluted with H2O and extracted with
EtOAc and 1 N HCl. The organic extract was dried and concentrated in
vacuo to give a residue which was subjected to column chromatography
(EtOAc:hexane 1:1) to give 5 (0.22 g, 55%). 1H-NMR 3.65-3.74 (m, 2H),
3.85 (s, 3H), 3.87 (s, 3H), 4.76 (m, 1H), 6.82-6.91(m, 3H).
